{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Melt</b> — as in 'אז תמוג הארץ וכל יושביה' (Psalm 75:4)." "And the sense of 'אנכי תכנתי' — then they will know that I am He who established its pillars truly of old." "And 'its pillars' — they are its mountains, which did not shake; and now when it totters, they will know that the earth is Mine; I do my will."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 75, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:34.999211900Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}